msgstr "How to Read AI-Generated Ads: A Practical Guide to Transparency Notices"

msgid "AirDropとの違い"
msgstr "Difference from AirDrop"

msgid "AirDropはAppleデバイス同士・近距離のみで使えます。FS!QRはAndroidでもWindowsでもブラウザがあれば動作し、離れた場所でも共有できます。"
msgstr ""
"AirDrop works only between nearby Apple devices. FS!QR works on Android "
"and Windows as long as a browser is available, and files can be shared "
"remotely."

