"iPhone has an \"Offload Unused Apps\" feature that removes the app binary"
" while keeping its data and settings intact, freeing up storage without "
"losing anything important."

msgid "iPhoneの写真は「HEIC」という形式で保存されていることがあり、送り先によっては開けない場合があります。互換性を優先するなら設定で「JPEG（互換性優先）」での撮影・書き出しを選びましょう。"
msgstr ""
"iPhone photos are often stored in a format called \"HEIC\", which some "
"recipients can't open. If compatibility matters more, choose \"Most "
"Compatible\" (JPEG) for shooting and exporting in the settings."

