msgstr ""
"Sending pictures as \"photos\" or \"images\" in a chat app is the classic"
" path to automatic compression: images sent normally in LINE, posts to "
"social feeds, attachments in some webmail services. Forward the same "
"image a few times and the compression stacks up, making it coarser each "
"time."

