msgstr ""
"Search and join existing real-time collaborative editing note rooms. You "
"can join and co-edit existing notes using your room ID and password."

msgid "既存の共有タスクボードを検索・参加。ルームIDとパスワードでチームのカンバンボードに参加できます。"
msgstr "Find and join an existing shared task board with its room ID and password."

